# No Em Dash

Never use the em dash character `—` (U+2014) in any file, copy, commit message, or UI text.

Always use a regular hyphen `-` instead.

Examples:
- Bad: `Ibnul Mutaki — Fall Stuck Developer`
- Good: `Ibnul Mutaki - Fall Stuck Developer`
